{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20262cytyodTfg1792635546.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>人民幣中間價連升兩天，見逾三年半高位。</p><p></p><p>官方開出的人民幣中間價報6.7147，較上個交易日上調18點子，是自2023年2月2日以來的高位。現貨人民幣方面，在岸價和離岸價早段都於6.66水平上落。</p><p></p><p>另外，人民銀行開展1,150億元人民幣7天期逆回購操作及1萬億元人民幣隔夜逆回購操作。扣除今日到期的逆回購，單日在市場淨投放1,150億元人民幣。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T03:01:26.137289+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":171,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T02:03:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T02:57:01.190018+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T02:58:29.969697+00:00","content_hash":"21a4fe8e2c31a4cd7611b2190b26de725626e4e8243d1d69a7c4f48ef3cb5179","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-29T03:01:26.137289+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}